F 1 "1M" V 1150 800 50  0000 C CNN
F 2 "Resistor_Axial" H 1200 800 50  0001 C CNN
F 3 "" H 1200 800 50  0001 C CNN
	1    1200 800
	1    0    0    -1  
$EndComp

$Comp
