P 1200 600
F 0 "#PWR01" H 1200 450 50  0001 C CNN
F 1 "+400V" H 1200 750 50  0000 C CNN
F 2 "" H 1200 600 50  0001 C CNN
F 3 "" H 1200 600 50  0001 C CNN
